 겨울의 시작인 입동(立冬)과 함께 지금부터는 수능 등 각종 시험과 인사 시즌이 이어지는 시기, 기도에 더해 늦단풍을 덤으로 즐길 수 있는 여행지를 찾았다. 가을과 겨울 사이, 만추에 더 빛나는 돌탑 순례기.","date":"2025-11-07T15:36:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/national/weekend/2025/11/08/B6BE5U67BFEJPGHPXUNSCO43TE/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"사회","categories":["society"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/national/?outputType=xml"},"title":"섬으로 가는 길","partialText":"","date":"2025-11-07T15:35:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/national/weekend/2025/11/08/5WWZPV6DNREENFSZ6VXUL2RU54/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"사회","categories":["society"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/national/?outputType=xml"},"title":"엄마의 정보력, 아빠의 무관심? 요즘은 ‘부모의 공부력’이 대세","partialText":"","date":"2025-11-07T15:30:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/national/weekend/2025/11/08/BZLFICGQJNASBNB6LMECH5QHQA/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"사회","categories":["society"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/national/?outputType=xml"},"title":"외교의 최종 병기, 음식","partialText":"","date":"2025-11-07T15:30:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/national/weekend/2025/11/08/XTYVGT7QMBFX5EAVLXMJR2IZ4Q/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"사회","categories":["society"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/national/?outputType=xml"},"title":"고등어","partialText":"","date":"2025-11-07T15:30:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/national/weekend/2025/11/08/CUZ5TSQUNBAPDMFMRHIGDO4U24/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"사회","categories":["society"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/national/?out